name=Secure Web Desktop App
name.zh=安全现代网页桌面应用 (跨平台)
desc=Lightweight Web desktop app: custom frameless HTML titlebar, native zero-latency window dragging, bidirectional IPC bridge, in-memory encrypted assets, random-port loopback server, and hardened anti-debugging security. The embedded web view needs Windows, macOS or Android.
desc.zh=轻量现代网页桌面应用：HTML自定义无边框标题栏、原生零延迟拖拽、双向IPC通信桥、全内存解密无落盘防逆向、全随机端口微服务与启动参数安全加固。内嵌网页视图需要 Windows/macOS/Android。
